# Food inflation after Russia's invasion of Ukraine, by region (ds243)
7COM1079 Team Research and Development Project, University of Hertfordshire.
Group 12: Alif, Hisam, Latifi, Muiz, Marvin.

## How to run
1. Open `7COM1079-0901-2026-Group_Project_G12.Rproj` in RStudio.
2. Open `Analysis.R` and click Source.
3. No extra packages are needed (base R only). Figures are saved in `figures/`.

## What is in Analysis.R
| Section | Owner | Output |
|---|---|---|
| 1. Prepare the data | Alif | data/processed/country_change.csv |
| 2. Descriptive statistics | Hisam | summaries and medians by region |
| 3. Figure 1 - histogram | Latifi | figures/fig1_histogram.png |
| 4. Figure 2 - boxplot by region | Muiz | figures/fig2_boxplot_by_region.png |
| 5. Summary table for the report | Marvin | figures/table1_summary_by_region.csv |

Data: World Bank Real-Time Food Prices, version 2 October 2023 (doi:10.48529/5hgz-q149).

